            "review_title": "Review at Nước Mía Vườn Cau",
            "review_text": "Cảnh Bình C\n3 contributions\n0\nBad employee attitude\nSep 2026 • Friends\nThe staff were not friendly or enthusiastic with the customers. There are quite a few items I really like and want to buy, so I proactively asked the staff for advice, but many times I was ignored and didn't receive an answer. I am quite disappointed with the service attitude, even though I really liked many of the dishes, so I just drank two glasses of water and left.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 5, 2026",
